fn run_part_4() {
    // Embedded PBAI & PB-MCP v10.0.0-embedded Quantum-Leap Suite (1064 Tools / 92 Lazy Modules / Medusa / SMT Termination / Time-Travel / Polyglot Transpiler / 5-Persona Council)
